<!--
  architecture.md C5: every user-visible string lives here. No literal may appear in a
  composable. design.md §8 sets the copy rules that all of these must obey:
    - never say "safe" unqualified
    - never blame the user
    - reading level <= grade 6, short sentences, no jargon
      ("fake website", not "phishing"; "web address", not "domain")
-->
